      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://fedoraproject.org/wiki/SystemTap&#34;&gt;SystemTap&lt;/a&gt; is a tool for gathering and investigating system-wide information about a running Linux system.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SystemTap eliminates the tedious instrument, compile, reinstall, reboot sequence involved in data collection.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
